{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985280/extras/624a48a9f500a2f9ddc2257801e20fe8.webp?t=1767811343\" width=617 height=57 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Can you reach the top?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super Chick is a 3D precision platformer where <strong>every mistake costs height</strong>. One run. Real stakes. Learn the routes, keep your composure, and turn hard sections into muscle memory.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985280/extras/517fb009b674c95be81af188961abfea.poster.avif?t=1767811343\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985280/extras/517fb009b674c95be81af188961abfea.webm?t=1767811343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985280/extras/517fb009b674c95be81af188961abfea.mp4?t=1767811343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Two modes, same climb</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Hardcore Climb:</strong> no safety net. The pure run (ideal for speedruns &amp; leaderboards)<br></li><li><strong>Checkpoint Mode:</strong> optional checkpoints so friends of different skill levels can still play together</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Built for precision (and momentum)</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Tight, responsive movement tuned for exact landings<br></li><li>Momentum-forward flow: clean jumps feel fast and satisfying<br></li><li>Readable setups: you can see the line, then you must commit</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Routes, shortcuts, and risk</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Multiple lines through sections: <strong>safe routes</strong> vs <strong>faster, riskier shortcuts</strong><br></li><li>High-reward paths demand consistency, not luck</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985280/extras/09f365c8210bc5855747793b1e183779.poster.avif?t=1767811343\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985280/extras/09f365c8210bc5855747793b1e183779.webm?t=1767811343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985280/extras/09f365c8210bc5855747793b1e183779.mp4?t=1767811343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solo or online</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Solo: the focused climb and personal bests<br></li><li>Online: practice together or race for cleaner runs</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Time Attack &amp; mastery</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Chase better times by choosing smarter lines<br></li><li>Replay for cleaner execution and faster splits</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A climb with personality</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Cute presentation, ruthless platforming<br></li><li>Secrets and easter eggs for explorers<br></li><li>Subtle Finnish flavor: retro-tech details and familiar skyline vibes</li></ul><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save to your Wishlist</strong> to get notified when Super Chick launches.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985280/extras/5a5d9762621a90894b89c860be191e95.poster.avif?t=1767811343\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985280/extras/5a5d9762621a90894b89c860be191e95.webm?t=1767811343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985280/extras/5a5d9762621a90894b89c860be191e95.mp4?t=1767811343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>","background":"https://store.a